  "comment": "Solves a scrambled cube. The prefab override sets jointPose to the state after the scramble L F2 L2 F' L D F2 D2 F' L F2 (L, F and D turn the x-, y- and z- layers clockwise seen from outside; corner 1 is fixed to the center). PosePaths then play the optimal 9-move solution L2 F2 L' D L' D' L2 D' L': the center and the corners outside the turning layer are held, and the turning layer's corner shells are dragged around the arc by position only, so their orientation comes from contact. Finally the solved cube is turned 180 degrees about z and then x to show all six faces. load.corner*.mag are the drive forces [N]."
